              body: `An <dfn data-def="A collection of items stored one after another in memory, each reachable by a number called its index.">array</dfn> stores items in one <dfn data-def="Right next to each other with no gaps — one solid block of memory.">contiguous</dfn> block. Each item has an <dfn data-def="The position number of an item. Arrays start counting at 0.">index</dfn>, starting at <b>0</b>.`,
